# Locally-downloaded copies of the actual copyrighted ad clips — never
# publish these. The deployed site plays every ad via its YouTube embed
# instead; see public/videos/README.md.
public/videos/*.mp4

# Unused reference photos of unknown/unclear licensing (real photographs,
# not referenced anywhere in the app) — don't publish these either.
# 90s_tv_room_bg.jpg is the exception: it's original AI-illustrated
# artwork actually used as the site's background, not a real photo, and
# the live site needs it committed since deploys now build from git.
public/images/*
!public/images/90s_tv_room_bg.jpg
!public/images/90s_tv_room_bg_mobile.jpg
public/retro-setup.jpg
.vercel
